3", "created_at": "2026-10-14T07:46:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110276029709422740"], "id": "2110276029709422740", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4764615733", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110275944036639068", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "📍 Naktala Udayan Sangha @ 40.\n\n🎨 Anirban Das.\n\n👉 All the artworks on the brick walls were done by hand!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 3/3 https://t.co/hQsSYSruMj", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110276029709422740"}, {"author_id": "1754865510939029506", "created_at": "2026-10-14T07:46:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110276027306082527"], "id": "2110276027306082527", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1974863360471486464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110271257958817917", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@9mmNeil He is jorking it", "url": "https://x.com/_Epinephrine_/status/2110276027306082527"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110275867968667648", "3_2110275889804312576", "3_2110275929583071232", "3_2110275954434301952"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-14T07:46:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110275970762702869"], "id": "2110275970762702869", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍 Dum Dum Mall Pally Sarbojanin.\n\n🎨 Partha Joardar.\n\n🌟 The pandal is made using 3,000KG of ropes.\n\n👉 Looks pretty decent. Although, it is not really worth visiting, if you live far away. Instagram has overhyped this pandal.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/s9TfO7LsQG https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110275970762702869"}, {"a