_tweets": [{"id": "2110275844581278110", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "📍 Naktala Udayan Sangha @ 40.\n\n🎨 Anirban Das.\n\n👉 The entire pandal has been made using bricks!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 2/3 https://t.co/YAsLYdp5zC", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110275944036639068"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110275845747351552", "3_2110275868077785088", "3_2110275890009780224", "3_2110275918052876288"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-14T07:46:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110275928333123625"], "id": "2110275928333123625", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍 Tala Barowari.\n\n🎨 Prasanta Pal.\n\n🌟 The theme is \"Durga Bari\", meaning the \"Home of Durga.\" It depicts the various avatars of shakti.\n\n👉 The pandal looks gorgeous. Although, the clay work could've been a lot better.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/3 https://t.co/Pwxlj11nMP https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110275928333123625"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110275830803054592", "3_2110275847018188800", "3_2110275868086177792", "3_2110275887912620032"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-14T07:46:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110275915926409664"], "id": "2110275915926409664", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍 Pratapaditya Road Trikon Park Sarbojanin.\n\n🎨 Bimal Samanta.\n\n🌟 The theme depicts the absurdity of life.\n\n👉 A very conceptual theme, with a practical perspective, that somehow falls flat in the end.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/3 https://t.co/X4yWYqH8lt https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110275915926409664"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110275860855230464", "3_2110275880685887488"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-14T07:45:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110275893298180458"], "id": "2110275893298180458", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4764615733", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110275846061818156", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "📍 Mudiali Club.\n\n🎨 Biman Saha.\n\n👉 Simplistic, yet, so majestic!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 2/2 https://t.co/LmPftbL8Oj", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110275893298180458"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110275823790129152", "3_2110275839309066240", "3_2110275860402204672"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-14T07:45:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110275879083663462"], "id": "2110275879083663462", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4764615733", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110275815103713459", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "📍 Telipukur Yuba Sangha.\n\n🎨 Bhabatosh Sutar.\n\n👉 The idol is really beautiful. The artworks are also very intricate.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 2/2 https://t.co/nx9zGg1WWq", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110275879083663462"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110275800499109888", "3_2110275823555276800", "3_2110275839409692672", "3_2110275859525550080"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-14T07:45:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110275877611425944"], "id": "2110275877611425944", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍 Tollygunge Santipally.\n\n🎨 N/A.\n\n🌟 The theme encourages education, and condemns child labour.\n\n👉 It was okayish.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/ZCrE1RfCfT https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110275877611425944"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110275770929332224", "3_2110275800008409088", "3_2110275816286523392", "3_2110275831444668416"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-14T07:45:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110275846061818156"], "id": "2110275846061818156", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍 Mudiali Club.\n\n🎨 Biman Saha.\n\n🌟 They always do traditional Durga Puja, inside a vibrant and catchy pandal.\n\n👉 Gorgeous! Especially the Chandannagar style Maa Durga! As I always say, they do the best 'sabeki' puja!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/2 https://t.co/WK8Bo14f40 https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110275846061818156"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110275783403204608", "3_2110275800591474688", "3_2110275815695110144", "3_2110275830006112256"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-14T07:45:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110275844581278110"], "id": "2110275844581278110", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍 Naktala Udayan Sangha @ 40.\n\n🎨 Anirban Das.\n\n🌟 The theme signifies the importance of 'panjika' in a Hindu Bengali's life since forever.\n\n👉 Arguably one of the finest concepts this year. The Maa Durga idol is simply breathtaking!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/3 https://t.co/cyVo6qlH5T https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110275844581278110"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_211027574797801881